  "6Nhm762vfF0": { title: "\"You Can Be a Heroine and Still Be Struggling\" Maybe It's Time to Ask Ourselves What Our Priorities Really Are. From the Episode with Chani Malul", description: "\"You can be a heroine and still be struggling\" What's expected of us as women can sometimes feel almost impossible! And maybe it's time to ask ourselves: what are our real priorities? From the episode with Chani Malul\n#Haredi #podcast #EstyShushan #news #HarediEducation #talkshow" },
